msgstr "确认用户的 AOI（感兴趣区域）。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:149
#: 7a85818ffa7c4b7892ff3f8e04bebbf9
msgid ""
"Suggest the most appropriate basemap provider based on the task and "
