msgstr "选修的"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:192
#: 961bc76989e54be4a3098c29da5c58cc
msgid "Lower values = more vertical (nadir) imagery = less distortion."
msgstr "较低的值 = 更多垂直（最低点）图像 = 更少的失真。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:193
#: 18bed717c01b446aa794bcf5881325a2
msgid "**Min AOI intersection**"
msgstr "**最小 AOI 交叉点**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:195
#: 5a5143bb7fb3406e8f38aefaaff0458d
msgid ""
"Minimum overlap between the image footprint and AOI. Default: 50.0 (50%)."
msgstr "图像足迹和 AOI 之间的最小重叠。默认值：50.0 (50%)。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:196
#: 79795e975f144a2ebd6cb5379e1ac9c8
msgid "**Resolution**"
msgstr "**解决**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:198
#: 33b1e9b827964634835ebf9fd7580db8
msgid ""
"``maxResolution`` in m/px. Should match the AI model requirements (see "
"Section 6)."
msgstr "“最大分辨率”，单位为米/像素。应符合 AI 模型要求（参见第 6 节）。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:199
#: 5f42ce13820b43128b2da6d089b6e9a7
msgid "**Product type**"
msgstr "**产品类型**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:201
#: 6187f1a6fbe5401e8fae0494665a6158
msgid "``IMAGE`` (single capture) or ``MOSAIC`` (pre-composed layer)."
msgstr "“IMAGE”（单次捕捉）或“MOSAIC”（预合成层）。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:203
#: e7e2f681583e4d1b937791d2149b7847
msgid "**4.2.1 Historical Imagery Search**"
msgstr "**4.2.1 历史图像搜索**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:205
#: 2d5881fc110045ad98f37c2caff99eda
msgid ""
"For tasks requiring specific past conditions (change detection, damage "
"assessment, agricultural monitoring):"
msgstr "对于需要特定过去条件的任务（变化检测、损害评估、农业监测）："

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:207
#: e7213515709147658050296594708188
msgid "Collect search parameters (table above)."
msgstr "收集搜索参数（上表）。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:208
#: 800695d6b6f04594b65f3d3f78d4a6a7
msgid "Execute the search via the Imagery Search API:"
msgstr "通过图像搜索 API 执行搜索："

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:224
#: 145731c854084acb830dd9bac355d100
msgid "Present results to user (see Section 5)."
msgstr "向用户呈现结果（参见第 5 节）。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:227
#: 8d335f9ac502498da8acabaa6a92df7c
msgid ""
"By default, the search is performed for ALL providers existing on the "
"platform. Thus, the search results may contain images that are not available"
" to the user for processing. Image availability means that "
"``imagejson.providerName in /user/status.searchDataProviders[]``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，将对平台上现有的所有提供商执行搜索。因此，搜索结果可能包含用户无法处理的图像。图像可用性意味着“/user/status.searchDataProviders[]"
" 中的 imagejson.providerName”。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:229
#: 39fac08118eb4316b8fa5288ba673fc1
msgid ""
"``\"hideUnavailable\": true`` filter can be provided to ensure that the "
"results include only images available for processing."
msgstr "可以提供``“hideUnavailable”：true``过滤器以确保结果仅包含可用于处理的图像。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:231
