msgstr "**5.1 排名标准（按优先顺序排列）：**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:267
#: bac72376e55a4d6ab08b6f57a85a30de
msgid ""
"**Provider availability** — Prioritize providers the user has access to "
"(\"Available for me\"). Images from unavailable providers cannot be used "
"without a plan upgrade."
msgstr "**提供商可用性** — 优先考虑用户有权访问的提供商（“对我可用”）。如果没有计划升级，则无法使用来自不可用提供商的图像。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:268
#: 438d4963939d42059ec62aa71f3e12ed
msgid ""
"**AOI coverage** — Higher intersection percentage between the image "
"footprint and the user's AOI is better."
msgstr "**AOI 覆盖率** — 图像足迹和用户 AOI 之间的交叉百分比越高越好。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:269
#: 0302fa84c57f4dcd89fd9b458c9eb7c5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Cloud cover** — Lower is better. Recommend images with ≤ 10% cloud cover."
msgstr "**云量** — 云量越低越好。推荐云量≤ 10% 的图像。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_agent_instructions.rst:270
#: 8994c553faf1481194f0a916a8635e3f
msgid ""
"**Recency** — More recent images are generally preferred unless the user "
"specified a historical date."
msgstr "**新近度** — 通常首选较新的图像，除非用户指定历史日期。"

